<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Wuzwear Industry - FAQs</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/whyus.css">
</head>
<body>
     <%- include('partials/nav') %>

    <main class="container scroll-reveal">
        
        <section class="faq-header">
            <h2>FAQs</h2>
            <p>Manufacturing custom clothes, especially as a start-up apparel brand, can feel overwhelming in today's competitive industry. At <strong>Wuzwear Industry</strong>, we aim to make the process as smooth as possible by answering some of the most common questions about our services, policies, and production process.</p>
            <p class="sub-notice">Please go through these FAQs before reaching out — it might save you time and help you plan better.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="faq-accordion">
            
            <div class="faq-item active">
                <button class="faq-toggle">
                    <span>What is the minimum order quantity for your apparel manufacturing services?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-up arrow-icon"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-content">
                    <p>Our minimum order quantity (MOQ) depends on the product type. For most items, the MOQ starts from <strong>50-100 pieces per style</strong>, but larger orders often come with better pricing.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-toggle">
                    <span>What is the duration of order receiving?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down arrow-icon"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-content">
                    <p>Standard production time typically ranges from 2 to 4 weeks depending on the order volume and design complexity. Shipping timelines vary based on your location and preferred method (air or sea freight).</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-toggle">
                    <span>Do you have any discount services or programs?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down arrow-icon"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-content">
                    <p>Yes, we offer bulk tier pricing models. The greater the volume of pieces per custom design pattern, the lower your per-unit manufacturing cost becomes.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-toggle">
                    <span>Can I order a sample before ordering?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down arrow-icon"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-content">
                    <p>Absolutely. We highly recommend creating a physical pre-production sample to review fabrics, measurements, and structural tailoring details before full manufacturing begins.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-toggle">
                    <span>What will happen to my order if I fail to approve the sample?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down arrow-icon"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-content">
                    <p>If a sample doesn't meet your design parameters, our technical pattern specialists work closely with you to adjust fitments or elements until it matches your specification sheet.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-toggle">
                    <span>Is your website apparel catalog all you have?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down arrow-icon"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-content">
                    <p>No, our capabilities go far beyond any catalog list. We can construct completely unique garments from raw concept imagery or custom physical tech packs.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-toggle">
                    <span>Can I bring my own garments for embroidery, screen printing, or other services?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down arrow-icon"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-content">
                    <p>We primarily offer full-package production sourcing the materials ourselves, but we do evaluate printing facilities options on client-provided blanks depending on project volume constraints.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-toggle">
                    <span>Do you send proofs prior to apparel production?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down arrow-icon"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-content">
                    <p>Yes, structural mockups and digitized embroidery or printing patterns are formally submitted for review and sign-off before manufacturing runs proceed.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </section>
    </main>

    <script src="../js/faqs.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>